## PHẦN 5: I18N (next-intl)

### 5.1 Translation Structure

Translations live in `apps/builder/messages/en.json`:

| Namespace | Purpose |
|-----------|---------|
| `fields.*` | Reusable field labels, placeholders |
| `actions.*` | Button/action labels |
| `messages.*` | Toast messages, confirmations |
| `.*` | Feature-specific text |

### 5.2 Form Fields — Reuse `fields.*`

```typescript
<InputField
  label={t("fields.name.label")}
  name="name"
  placeholder={t("fields.name.placeholder")}
  required
/>
```

**Never hardcode labels:**

```typescript
// WRONG
<InputField label="Username" name="username" />

// CORRECT
<InputField label={t("fields.username.label")} name="username" />
```

### 5.3 Actions & Messages

```typescript
// Buttons
{t("actions.cancel")}
{t("actions.create")}
{t("actions.save")}

// Toast messages
toast.success(t("messages.createdSuccess", { feature: "Contact" }))
toast.error(error.serverError || t("messages.unknownError"))
```

