## PHẦN 6: CODING RULES

### 6.1 Data Access (NEVER do these)

```
🚫 DO NOT import `db` directly in apps/ or integrations/
🚫 DO NOT use dynamic `import()` — breaks tsdown build
🚫 DO NOT hardcode user-facing strings — use useTranslations()
🚫 DO NOT use console.log/error/warn in server code — use logger
```

### 6.2 Correct Patterns

| What | Do This |
|------|---------|
| DB access | Service (`@chatbotx.io/business`) or Repository |
| Logging (server) | `logger.error({ err: error }, "message")` |
| i18n | `useTranslations()` + `t()` |
| Action client | `workspaceActionClient` or `authActionClient` |
| Route auth | Middleware (`@/middlewares/auth`) |

### 6.3 Business Logic

Business logic services **MUST** live in `packages/business/src/<feature>/service.ts`:

```typescript
// packages/business/src/<feature>/service.ts
export class MyService extends BaseService {
  async create(params: CreateParams): Promise<MyEntity> {
    // Business logic here
  }
}

export const myService = new MyService()
```

### 6.4 Model Routing (Cost Optimization)

| Task | Model Tier |
|------|------------|
| File lookup, grep, inventory | Haiku / Sonnet |
| Implementation, code review, debugging | Sonnet |
| Architecture, synthesis, incident root-cause | Opus |

