## PHẦN 8: CHECKLISTS

### 8.1 New Feature Checklist

1. Create `src/features/<feature>/` directory
2. Define Zod schemas in `schema/`
3. Create DB queries in `queries/` (call business service)
4. Add server actions in `actions/`
5. Create oRPC API in `api/` (if needed)
6. Register router in `src/routers/index.ts`
7. Create page(s) under `src/app/space/[workspaceId]/...`
8. Build UI components
9. Add i18n translations — reuse `fields.*`, add feature text
10. Verify no hardcoded strings

### 8.2 Database Checklist

1. Define table schema with `sharedColumns`
2. Add indexes and unique constraints
3. Define relations if needed
4. Update `src/schema/index.ts`
5. Update `src/types.ts`
6. Update `src/relations/index.ts` (import + spread)
7. Run migration: `pnpm --filter @chatbotx.io/database make:migration <name>`
8. Apply: `pnpm --filter @chatbotx.io/database db:migrate`

### 8.3 Worker Checklist

1. Define queue name in `packages/worker-config/src/lib/types.ts`
2. Create job types in `packages/worker-config/src/queues/<name>/`
3. Export from `packages/worker-config/src/index.ts`
4. Create worker in `apps/worker/src/<domain>/worker.ts`
5. Register entry in `apps/worker/tsdown.config.ts`
6. Add dev script in `apps/worker/package.json`

